# Exports

Some customers have more than 200,000 invoices, so an export never runs inside an HTTP request.
The route enqueues a job on src/jobs/queue.js and answers 202 with the job id. The client polls
GET /jobs/:id and downloads the file once the job is done.

config/server.json sets timeout_ms. The load balancer kills any request still running after that.

